        dct:description "SHA-256 pinned specimen — datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-033/helianthus_annuus_capitulum_specimen.jpg: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-033_on-leaf-arrangement-or-phyllotaxis.py at f1d96f32ba3f00517c53e9cd007634306cc8d4f4, image/jpeg, 398926 B, 1000×750 px, artifact_sha256 c76483eea3e564fee9cf41913e03fc0874ea95b23e82aa901f5d083d074546ff (sha256 c76483eea3e564fee9cf41913e03fc0874ea95b23e82aa901f5d083d074546ff), spec_fingerprint 76e623bd0fb2355aebb0e2e097002b099b16ff9048a213066b74c6c94c38eddc" .
